          "diagramHtml": "<div class='example-diagram-card'>Proportion: AB / EF = BC / FG<br>8 / 20 = 12 / FG<br>Cross multiply: 8 × FG = 20 × 12 = 240<br><strong>FG = 240 / 8 = 30 cm</strong></div>",
